same time as for other participants, following completion and certification of the performance results for the applicable performance period; and \u2022Welfare benefit continuation for two years following the termination of his employment, if Mr. Debertin chooses to retire from the Company.\nMs. Nelligan\nMs. Nelligan's compensation is governed by a letter agreement entered into on January 7, 2020 (the \"Nelligan Letter Agreement\"). Under the Nelligan Letter Agreement, Ms. Nelligan's target AVP award will be no less than 1.15x her annual base salary as of August 31 each year.\nMr. Smith\n"}
